cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: 'delphyR: Reproducible Round-Based Delphi Studies and Multilingual Workflows'
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Heller
    given-names: R.
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8006-9742
repository-code: https://github.com/CTTIR/delphyR
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  The delphyR repository contains the delphyr R package for reproducible
  round-based Delphi studies and the delphyrApp package for English, French
  and German Shiny workflows. It supports validated protocols, deterministic
  consensus classification, offline analysis of frozen round snapshots and
  transactional PostgreSQL services. Production authentication, deployment
  and study acceptance remain separate gates.
keywords:
  - Delphi studies
  - consensus
  - reproducible research
  - R
  - Shiny
